    - language: 3
      text: "\u3053\u306E\u5BFE\u6226\u3092\u7D9A\u3051\u3088\u3046\u3002"
    - language: 4
      text: "\uC774 \uB300\uACB0\uC744 \uACC4\uC18D\uD558\uC790."
    - language: 5
      text: Reprendre cette partie.
    - language: 6
      text: Dieses Match fortsetzen.
    - language: 7
