        CC0 1.0\nAureolus_Omicron \u2014 CC0 1.0\nSonican \u2014 Pixabay Content
        License"
    - language: 3
      text: "\u97F3\u697D\njuanjo_sound \u2014 \u4F5C\u8005\u306E\u5229\u7528\u898F\u7D04\nCenturion_of_war
        \u2014 CC0 1.0\nAureolus_Omicron \u2014 CC0 1.0\nSonican \u2014 Pixabay Content
        License"
