      text: "\u9644\u4FE1"
    - language: 1
      text: "\u9644\u4FE1"
    - language: 2
      text: Attached letter
    - language: 3
      text: "\u6DFB\u4ED8\u306E\u624B\u7D19"
    - language: 4
      text: "\uCCA8\uBD80\uB41C \uD3B8\uC9C0"
    - language: 5
      text: Lettre jointe
    - language: 6
      text: "Beigef\xFCgter Brief"
    - language: 7
      text: Carta adjunta
    - language: 8
      text: Carta em anexo
    - language: 9
      text: "\u041F\u0440\u0438\u043B\u043E\u0436\u0435\u043D\u043D\u043E\u0435 \u043F\u0438\u0441\u044C\u043C\u043E"
  - key: postgame.farewell.notification.body
    values:
    - language: 0
      text: "\u7ED9\u4F60\u7559\u4E86\u4E00\u5C01\u4FE1\u3002"
    - language: 1
      text: "\u7D66\u4F60\u7559\u4E86\u4E00\u5C01\u4FE1\u3002"
    - language: 2
      text: I left you a letter.
    - language: 3
      text: "\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306B\u624B\u7D19\u3092\u6B8B\u3057\u305F\u3088\u3002"
    - language: 4
      text: "\uB108\uC5D0\uAC8C \uD3B8\uC9C0\uB97C \uB0A8\uACBC\uC5B4."
    - language: 5
      text: "Je t\u2019ai laiss\xE9 une lettre."
    - language: 6
      text: Ich habe dir einen Brief hinterlassen.
    - language: 7
      text: Te he dejado una carta.
    - language: 8
      text: "Deixei uma carta para voc\xEA."
    - language: 9
      text: "\u042F \u043E\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u0438\u043B\u0430 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435
        \u043F\u0438\u0441\u044C\u043C\u043E."
